            <section class="bb-card">
                <h3 class="bb-card-title"><span class="bb-dot bb-dot-success"></span> Coming from EF Core?</h3>
                <p class="bb-card-desc">Keep your DbContext: <code>UseBlazeDb</code> maps it onto the engine, and LINQ lands on the indexes.</p>
                <a href="efcore" class="btn btn-outline">EF Core →</a>
