    <section class="bb-final-cta">
        <h2>Put a database in the tab</h2>
        <p class="bb-section-sub">One package, one partial class, one <code>OpenAsync</code> - and your reads stop waiting on anything.</p>
        <pre class="bb-code bb-hero-install">dotnet add package Bit.BlazeDb</pre>
        <div class="bb-hero-actions">
